in'."}, {"i": 135, "start": 193.24, "end": 195.23, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Goku", "text": "Vegeta, What did you do?"}, {"i": 136, "start": 195.23, "end": 196.5, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "Nothinguh!"}, {"i": 137, "start": 196.5, "end": 197.0, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Goku", "text": "What."}, {"i": 138, "start": 197.0, "end": 197.5, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Goku", "text": "What. Did"}, {"i": 139, "start": 197.5, "end": 198.0, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Goku", "text": "What. Did. You."}, {"i": 140, "start": 198.0, "end": 198.5, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Goku", "text": "What. Did. You. Do?"}, {"i": 141, "start": 198.5, "end": 199.26, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "I f*cked your mom!"}, {"i": 142, "start": 199.26, "end": 200.96, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Goku", "text": "I don't have a mom!"}, {"i": 143, "start": 201.4, "end": 202.58, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "Neither do I..."}, {"i": 144, "start": 204.54, "end": 206.66, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "Hey Mr. Piccolo! I'm super saiyan."}, {"i": 145, "start": 206.66, "end": 207.68, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Piccolo", "text": "NO, YOU'RE ME!"}, {"i": 146, "start": 208.52, "end": 209.02, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "A$AP Rocky - Fashion Killa plays in the background"}, {"i": 147, "start": 209.02, "end": 210.08, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "Cash. [A$AP Rocky - Fashion Killa plays in the background]"}, {"i": 148, "start": 210.08, "end": 212.22, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Future Trunks", "text": "By the way, we don't have Dragon Balls anymore so-"}, {"i": 149, "start": 212.22, "end": 213.6, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Goku", "text": "But then what are we in!?"}, {"i": 150, "start": 213.74, "end": 214.24, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "pop"}, {"i": 151, "start": 215.5, "end": 216.32, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Goku", "text": "Goku fix."}, {"i": 152, "start": 216.32, "end": 217.56, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Dende", "text": "Okay, so I'm God now."}, {"i": 153, "start": 217.56, "end": 218.06, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Mr. Popo", "text": "Bet."}, {"i": 154, "start": 218.06, "end": 218.84, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Dende", "text": "Sick."}, {"i": 155, "start": 218.84, "end": 219.92, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Goku", "text": "Tournament time!"}, {"i": 156, "start": 220.78, "end": 222.62, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Alucard", "text": "Hey, we still doing those versus videos? [Hellsing Ultimate theme plays in the background]"}, {"i": 157, "start": 222.78, "end": 223.46, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Perfect Cell", "text": "Nope!"}, {"i": 158, "start": 223.46, "end": 224.98, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Alucard", "text": "Ah, no worries."}, {"i": 159, "start": 225.92, "end": 227.62, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Goku", "text": "I Like that guy's coat."}, {"i": 160, "start": 227.7, "end": 230.64, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Perfect Cell", "text": "Welcome to the Cell Games, everybody. Here are the brackets."}, {"i": 161, "start": 230.94, "end": 232.9, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Future Trunks", "text": "Wait, how is that a tournament?"}, {"i": 162, "start": 232.9, "end": 236.58, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Perfect Cell", "text": "Hey don't hate the Cell player, hate the Cell Games."}, {"i": 163, "start": 236.58, "end": 237.36, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Mr. Satan", "text": "What about-"}, {"i": 164, "start": 237.36, "end": 238.6, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Mr. Satan", "text": "GOKU & PERFECT CELL: Shut the f*ck up!"}, {"i": 165, "start": 238.6, "end": 240.56, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Mr. Satan", "text": "They didn't really change my character anyway."}, {"i": 166, "start": 240.56, "end": 242.72, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Goku", "text": "All right! Let's go Cell!"}, {"i": 167, "start": 242.72, "end": 244.32, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Perfect Cell", "text": "With pleasure!"}, {"i": 168, "start": 244.84, "end": 245.34, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Perfect Cell", "text": "AUGH!"}, {"i": 169, "start": 245.43, "end": 246.66, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Goku", "text": "Ow! I quit!"}, {"i": 170, "start": 246.66, "end": 247.82, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Goku", "text": "Gohan, get 'em!"}, {"i": 171, "start": 247.82, "end": 248.32, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "What!?!"}, {"i": 172, "start": 248.32, "end": 249.08, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Perfect Cell", "text": "NANI!?!"}, {"i": 173, "start": 249.08, "end": 250.78, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Goku", "text": "In a year."}, {"i": 174, "start": 251.54, "end": 253.08, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "NNNOOOOOOOOOOOOO!!!"}, {"i": 175, "start": 253.08, "end": 254.04, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Perfect Cell", "text": "Wait, did we just skip my children? GOHAN: NNNOOOOOOOOOOOOO!!!"}, {"i": 176, "start": 254.04, "end": 255.28, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Perfect Cell", "text": "Wait, did we just skip my children?"}, {"i": 177, "start": 255.28, "end": 255.88, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Perfect Cell", "text": "Wait, did we just skip my childr--ah. [Mario power down sound effect]"}, {"i": 178, "start": 255.88, "end": 257.58, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "Get lost, ya dingus."}, {"i": 179, "start": 257.72, "end": 259.62, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell", "text": "I'm no dingus..."}, {"i": 180, "start": 259.62, "end": 261.18, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell", "text": "YOU'RE A DINGUS!!!"}, {"i": 181, "start": 261.18, "end": 262.52, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "will.i.am - Big and Chunky plays in the background"}, {"i": 182, "start": 262.52, "end": 264.26, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "Oh god, I killed us all!"}, {"i": 183, "start": 264.54, "end": 266.9, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Goku", "text": "No, Gohan. Just me."}, {"i": 184, "start": 267.56, "end": 268.68, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "NOOOOOO-"}, {"i": 185, "start": 268.68, "end": 270.32, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Super Perfect Cell", "text": "JK, not dead, LOL."}, {"i": 186, "start": 270.32, "end": 271.24, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Future Trunks", "text": "NOOOOOO-"}, {"i": 187, "start": 271.24, "end": 271.8, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Future Trunks", "text": "AUGH!"}, {"i": 188, "start": 272.08, "end": 273.86, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Super Perfect Cell", "text": "No! Enough of that!"}, {"i": 189, "start": 274.14, "end": 277.98, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Super Perfect Cell", "text": "Now listen up. Y'all been skipping my best shit since I got here."}, {"i": 190, "start": 277.98, "end": 281.08, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Super Perfect Cell", "text": "Ranked me as fourth-best villain under King Piccolo!"}, {"i": 191, "start": 281.34, "end": 284.02, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Super Perfect Cell", "text": "I'm Perfect Cell, motherf*ckers!"}, {"i": 192, "start": 284.02, "end": 285.92, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Super Perfect Cell", "text": "So Dende on f*cking Earth!"}, {"i": 193, "start": 285.92, "end": 289.3, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Super Perfect Cell", "text": "You better recognize the crackle of my RAW,"}, {"i": 194, "start": 289.68, "end": 291.84, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Super Perfect Cell", "text": "SSSSEXUAL ENERGY,"}, {"i": 195, "start": 291.84, "end": 295.36, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Super Perfect Cell", "text": "and line your 1990s asses up so I can-"}, {"i": 196, "start": 295.36, "end": 296.88, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "HAAAAAA!!!"}, {"i": 197, "start": 296.88, "end": 299.1, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Super Perfect Cell", "text": "This time I'ma let it all come out."}, {"i": 198, "start": 299.1, "end": 301.58, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Super Perfect Cell", "text": "This time I'ma stand up and shout."}, {"i": 199, "start": 301.58, "end": 303.36, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Super Perfect Cell", "text": "I'ma do things my way."}, {"i": 200, "start": 303.36, "end": 305.0, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Super Perfect Cell", "text": "It's my way!"}, {"i": 201, "start": 305.0, "end": 308.48, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Super Perfect Cell", "text": "My way or the high~"}, {"i": 202, "start": 308.48, "end": 311.3, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Super Perfect Cell", "text": "My way or the high waaaay~"}, {"i": 203, "start": 311.3, "end": 312.3, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Super Perfect Cell", "text": "CHIIIP"}, {"i": 204, "start": 314.3, "end": 315.4, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Krillin", "text": "Gohan beat Cell!"}, {"i": 205, "start": 315.4, "end": 316.96, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Piccolo", "text": "But at what cost?"}, {"i": 206, "start": 318.32, "end": 319.8, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Piccolo", "text": "Oh right, no cost."}, {"i": 207, "start": 319.8, "end": 320.78, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Piccolo", "text": "Hooray!"}, {"i": 208, "start": 320.78, "end": 322.36, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Shenron", "text": "New balls, who dis?"}, {"i": 209, "start": 322.36, "end": 323.64, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yamcha", "text": "Bring back the deads!"}, {"i": 210, "start": 323.64, "end": 324.28, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Shenron", "text": "Done."}, {"i": 211, "start": 324.28, "end": 325.6, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Krillin", "text": "Give me a girlfriend!"}, {"i": 212, "start": 325.6, "end": 326.38, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Shenron", "text": "Done."}, {"i": 213, "start": 326.38, "end": 327.78, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Goku", "text": "I'm gonna stay dead."}, {"i": 214, "start": 327.78, "end": 328.52, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Shenron", "text": "Done!"}, {"i": 215, "start": 328.52, "end": 329.02, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "What!?"}, {"i": 216, "start": 329.64, "end": 331.44, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Goku", "text": "You're Goku now..."}, {"i": 217, "start": 334.18, "end": 336.26, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Goku", "text": "I-I meant *for* now."}, {"i": 218, "start": 336.26, "end": 338.3, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "Dragon Soul!"}, {"i": 219, "start": 341.46, "end": 343.74, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "Wow! I wonder what's next for me?"}, {"i": 220, "start": 345.82, "end": 347.04, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Piccolo", "text": "You peaked."}, {"i": 221, "start": 347.04, "end": 347.6, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "What?"}, {"i": 222, "start": 347.6, "end": 348.68, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Piccolo", "text": "You peaked."}, {"i": 223, "start": 348.68, "end": 349.62, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "You're kidding!"}, {"i": 224, "start": 349.62, "end": 350.88, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "After all that!?"}, {"i": 225, "start": 350.88, "end": 352.4, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Piccolo", "text": "Yeah, sorry."}, {"i": 226, "start": 352.7, "end": 355.34, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "But...b-but I get stronger though, right?"}, {"i": 227, "start": 355.34, "end": 357.16, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Piccolo", "text": "Yeah, but..."}, {"i": 228, "start": 357.16, "end": 358.12, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Piccolo", "text": "...no."}, {"i": 229, "start": 358.44, "end": 359.46, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "...oh."}, {"i": 230, "start": 363.24, "end": 366.06, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "16: By the way, I never died in this version."}], "segments": []}